#ASSERT `s 2012(m)(4) the individual or group may constitute a household` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE  -- "live with others and pay compensation to the others for meals"
#ASSERT `s 2012(m)(4) the individual or group may constitute a household` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING  -- the paragraph only bars; it does not say anyone else may constitute a household
